The '''abhorrent spectre''' is a [[superior]] variant of the [[aberrant spectre]]. It has a chance of spawning after purchasing the unlock ''Bigger and Badder'' for 50 [[Slayer reward point|Slayer reward points]] from any [[Slayer master]]. Like their standard variant, a [[nose peg]] or [[Slayer helmet]] is required to safely engage them, as otherwise the player will take rapid damage and have their stats drained.

