==Trivia==
*Their in-game models resemble and they use the same animations as [[giants]], similarly to [[nechryarch]]s.
*Their examine text is a reference to the [[Ape Atoll Agility Course]], for which the player has to wear a [[Monkey greegree (small ninja)|Ninja]] or [[Kruk monkey greegree]], effectively dressing as a monkey. 3145 laps of the agility course would amount to 1,824,100 Agility experience, enough to reach level 79 if a player started from level 48, the minimum Agility level required to complete the course.

